<description>&lt;p&gt;ISIL suicide bombers attacked security facilities in Hasakah, killing two Syrian security force members, and carried out a suicide attack in northeastern Syria that killed two security personnel. Iran launched missiles at militants in Syria in response to a parade attack, while the UAE, Jordan, Egypt and other regional states condemned recent attacks on Syrian security forces. Syrian authorities are replacing Russian Kalashnikovs with Turkish KCR556 rifles for their security forces. Tourists are beginning to return to Syria. The UCDP recorded 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE9zZWhzX3JnN0lod3RuWVhhSzZqRlZ5U2ttWEl2b0UtSzV0QVNjWGMzMVFsbzEtOTFYQjdxNG1EVmpvRVFRNDk1TlEtOEw0S0R4ZU1IMGZ0ck15MU55c1ZqakFvazFJdTlZSURpdmNUWnlwemFVY3BIMkpweXh3WnM?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxQR1hmM01BSE00SkZJbmQ0MllwZGx0Tk01bmE5NmR1cDRvek9Gb3lpWEQyM0d6Y2tGS0JnMVowOUtFTllfeWt4bXFXQmRjRnZXNkltYlprX0dGOEVZLUJSazRIZzE1YXNEWVdYcERiYzBXSTVJUk9WZ0lzXzNxV0E5SzgyQ3JFMlFubFRRS2I4TVBWcEtLNTk2cUNtNkV1d2Q4eXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Economist&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxOeVVjcTQ3MHRwTXFGZktkdlU1a0hmUElnVjkxbE5SelU1QnJIV05ZSXhaTjNaa2NEY2szWFhXQnBEdzJPbE1FSGVNSWx3WDNkNXRldWxTbktmWHBtY0JwVkp2cUVsNDdXU0x0UkhKblowQmx1Nksxd2tjU3VkU1pJS3k1cXJnMkpJQW9aUkJ4Y3dTYkhBOGxJWnRwLVl4clBCRGhnUWo0U3F6WTFYN09BY0dBT0ZTemkzWXpF?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Safak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBRRHNXSnU5VnM5a1h2bFI1aF9QODZubEJORzlRUllpdzNrUERwbHhvc2dQU1cwOFpJOFot